      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**kube-state-metrics is scraped by two jobs** on this cluster:\n\n- `job=\"kube-state-metrics\"` \u2014 the **clean** one (correct `namespace`/`node` labels)\n- `job=\"kubernetes-service-endpoints\"` \u2014 a `honor_labels` collision that double-counts every `kube_*` series and mangles `namespace` -> `monitoring`\n\nAlways scope `kube_*` queries to `job=\"kube-state-metrics\"`.\n\nThe table/graph -> both jobs report the **same** `kube_pod_info` count = pure duplication. See TALOS-57t."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "kube_pod_info series count by job",
      "datasource": {
